    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if the \"imperfection\" is too much? like, if i stay, i'm just a constant reminder of what went wrong. i see the pride in their eyes when they talk about the future, and it just kills me because i know i'm not part of it anymore. wouldn't it be easier for them to just remember the version of me that actually succeeded, instead of having to deal with the reality of who i am now?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
